    <dt>SkoolKit Spectrum ROM disassembly</dt>
    <dd><a href="https://skoolkit.ca/disassemblies/rom/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://skoolkit.ca/disassemblies/rom/</a></dd>
    <dt>Gunther Strube — currah_uspeech_tests</dt>
    <dd><a href="https://github.com/maziac/currah_uspeech_tests" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://github.com/maziac/currah_uspeech_tests</a></dd>
    <dt>Spectrum Computing — Currah MicroSpeech</dt>
    <dd><a href="https://spectrumcomputing.co.uk/entry/1000081/Hardware/Currah_MicroSpeech" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://spectrumcomputing.co.uk/entry/1000081/Hardware/Currah_MicroSpeech</a></dd>
